# Issue #787's host-crash repro, EXECUTED. A Heritage short alias in REPORTER position whose
# canonical is a user procedure. `execute()` runs `parse()` only and never `check()`, so this path
# is the runtime's alone. Before the fix it raised a raw host `TypeError` instead of any `ol-*`
# diagnostic; it must simply run the user's `forward` and print 55.
define forward
  return 55
end
print fd
